cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FEMMI in your research or software, please cite it as below."
title: "FEMMI: Finite Element Mass Map Inversion"
abstract: >-
  A P3 finite-element / boundary-element pipeline for weak gravitational lensing
  mass reconstruction. FEMMI solves the lensing Poisson problem with an exact
  exterior (far-field) boundary condition via boundary elements, reconstructs the
  convergence by Morozov-regularised MAP inversion with pluggable priors
  (Gaussian/Matern, total variation, sparsity, maximum entropy, and a learned
  neural score prior), and provides posterior uncertainty quantification through a
  differentiable forward operator.
authors:
